"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    u32 slot </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> log2l</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(delta);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (slot </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 32</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) slot </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 31</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    u64 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">count_ptr </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> bpf_map_lookup_elem</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">latency_hist, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">slot);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (count_ptr)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        __sync_fetch_and_add</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(count_ptr, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这种模式将每秒可能数十万次的 IO 事件压缩为 32 个计数器的更新，用户态只需定期读取 32 个值即可绘制延迟分布图。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>Map 是唯一的数据通道</strong>：内核态与用户态通过 map 双向交换数据，pin 到 <code>/sys/fs/bpf/</code> 可跨进程、跨程序存活</li>\n<li><strong>按访问模式选类型</strong>：高频计数用 per-CPU 变体消除锁竞争，有界连接表用 LRU_HASH 自动淘汰，事件流一律用 Ring Buffer</li>\n<li><strong>Helper 是唯一的内核入口</strong>：所有内核服务调用必须经由预定义 helper，verifier 在加载时校验参数类型</li>\n<li><strong>在源头聚合</strong>：把过滤与聚合（如 log2 直方图）放进内核，仅传递紧凑结果，可把每秒数十万事件压缩为几十个计数器</li>\n<li><strong>内存需规划</strong>：map 内存计入 locked memory 配额，per-CPU map 的实际开销需乘以 CPU 数</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>相关文档</strong>：<a href=\"ebpf-architecture\">eBPF 架构与执行模型</a> 详解 verifier 如何验证 map 操作的安全性；<a href=\"ebpf-program-types\">eBPF 程序类型详解</a> 说明各类型程序可使用的 helper 集合。</p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"eBPF Map 与 Helper 函数","id":"ebpf-map-与-helper-函数"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Map 核心机制","id":"map-核心机制"},{"level":2,"text":"Map 类型详解","id":"map-类型详解"},{"level":3,"text":"Hash Map 与 Per-CPU Hash Map","id":"hash-map-与-per-cpu-hash-map"},{"level":3,"text":"Ring Buffer：现代事件传输通道","id":"ring-buffer-现代事件传输通道"},{"level":3,"text":"Stack Trace Map","id":"stack-trace-map"},{"level":2,"text":"Helper 函数体系","id":"helper-函数体系"},{"level":3,"text":"核心 Helper 分类","id":"核心-helper-分类"},{"level":3,"text":"关键 Helper 详解","id":"关键-helper-详解"},{"level":3,"text":"BPF_CORE_READ 宏","id":"bpf_core_read-宏"},{"level":2,"text":"Map 操作模式与性能考量","id":"map-操作模式与性能考量"},{"level":3,"text":"批量操作（Linux 5.6+）","id":"批量操作-linux-5-6"},{"level":3,"text":"并发安全","id":"并发安全"},{"level":2,"text":"Map 内存管理","id":"map-内存管理"},{"level":2,"text":"实用模式：直方图计算","id":"实用模式-直方图计算"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"eBPF 程序类型详解","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/ebpf-observability/foundations/ebpf-program-types"},"next":{"title":"网络可观测性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/ebpf-observability/observability/network-observability"}}